Compact Raid Frames — stock 3.3.5a backport
============================================

ORIGIN & ATTRIBUTION
--------------------
The "Compact Raid Frame" / CompactRaidFrame raid UI system is the work of
Blizzard Entertainment. It was packaged and adapted into a 3.3.5a addon by
Tsoukie:

    https://gitlab.com/Tsoukie/compactraidframe-3.3.5

The upstream Tsoukie project carries NO explicit software license on its
GitLab repository. Accordingly, this backport adds no license of its own and
makes no additional grant of rights: all rights to the original code and
artwork remain with their respective authors (Blizzard Entertainment and
Tsoukie). The same terms (or absence thereof) as the upstream project apply.

THIS VERSION IS INDEPENDENT
---------------------------
This repository is an INDEPENDENT backport to stock World of Warcraft 3.3.5a,
maintained by Jedborg. It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by,
or otherwise connected to Tsoukie or the upstream project in any way. The
original came from Tsoukie's project; this version is a separate effort and
should not be attributed to, or confused with, his.

It is provided AS-IS, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, for
use on private 3.3.5a (Wrath of the Lich King) servers.

BUNDLED LIBRARIES
-----------------
The bundled libraries under Libs/ — LibHealComm-4.0, AbsorbsMonitor-1.0,
LibGroupTalents-1.0, LibTalentQuery-1.0, LibResComm-1.0, Ace3 (AceComm,
AceEvent, AceTimer, AceSerializer), CallbackHandler-1.0, ChatThrottleLib and
LibStub — remain under their own respective licenses, held by their
respective authors.

TRADEMARKS
